linkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">ホントの時間（<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">3rdSG</span>）</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">川は流れる（<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">3rdSG</span>）</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">まさか　偶然…（<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">3rdSG</span>）</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">Footsteps（<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">1stSG</span>）</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">My god（<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">2ndSG</span>）</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">Cage（<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">2ndSG</span>）</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">Dash＆<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">Rush</span>（<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">2ndSG</span>）</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">ナゼー（<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">4thSG</span>）</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><strong style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">リテイク曲</strong></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">誰よりも高く跳べ！<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">2020</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">NO WAR in the future 2020</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">約束の卵<span style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;2020</span></p>